WEBVTT

00:13:29.829 --> 00:13:33.204
those of you with the power
of your positions

00:13:33.246 --> 00:13:36.121
and the protection of your whiteness

00:13:36.162 --> 00:13:39.871
and other societal privileges
you did not earn,

00:13:39.912 --> 00:13:41.746
to take on that risk instead.

00:13:43.496 --> 00:13:46.371
There's an opportunity
in this movement for change

00:13:46.412 --> 00:13:49.287
for you to do just that -- change.

00:13:50.912 --> 00:13:53.329
Not your hearts and minds.

00:13:53.371 --> 00:13:57.621
Close the gap between what you say

00:13:57.662 --> 00:13:59.371
and how we're treated.